menu "CEC telemetry"

    config CEC_TELEMETRY_UART0
        bool "Compile the dedicated TelePlot UART transport"
        default n
        help
            Routes every TelePlot line through a dedicated UART (the
            CH340K UART USB-C on the s3 boards, 921600 baud) once the
            app calls cec_telemetry_init_uart, keeping burst dumps off
            the CLI/console wire. Disabled: the init call returns
            ESP_ERR_NOT_SUPPORTED and TelePlot output stays on stdio.

endmenu
